          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il contrôle les fleurs qu’il cultive. Les tempêtes de pétales qu’il déchaîne sont aussi belles que redoutables.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It controls the flowers it grows. The petal blizzards that Florges triggers are overwhelming in their beauty and power.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "育てた　花々を　操る。 フラージェスの　放つ　花吹雪は 美しさも　パワーも　圧倒的。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "すうひゃくねんの　じゅみょうをもつ。 ていえんを　まもりつづけることに その　いっしょうを　ささげるという。",
